cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DiffDet in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "DiffDet: Foggy Object Detection through Lightweight Feature-Space Denoising"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Zhang"
    given-names: "Yimu"
    email: "yihang200407@163.com"
    # Replace with the actual author list from the final manuscript.
repository-code: "https://github.com/yimu-15/Diffdet"
url: "https://github.com/yimu-15/Diffdet"
abstract: >-
  DiffDet inserts a lightweight residual feature-denoising U-Net at the C5
  position of Sparse R-CNN (ResNet-50 + FPN) to perform diffusion-inspired,
  single-pass feature-space denoising for foggy object detection, with
  teacher-student distillation and weight-only INT8 quantization.
keywords:
  - object detection
  - foggy weather
  - feature denoising
  - knowledge distillation
  - quantization
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-05"
